WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
I won’t change yesterday’s fight

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:04,680
A sea rope for a pig leg Zhang Feifei, let me ask you something

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,210
Do you think you are beautiful? Is that okay?

4
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,250
Why do you ask this?

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,570
Since I think I look beautiful

6
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,690
Then don't think too beautiful

7
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,890
I want to exchange a sea rope for a pig leg

8
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,050
You want to eat shit? Then how do you want to exchange one pork leg for a few?

9
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,090
All three in your hand

10
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:22,730
You're pressing too hard now. I promised to wait until the pig's legs are separated and I'll give it to you, but you won't agree.

11
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:26,890
You can take the sea rope away now and I won’t stop you to make a deal.

12
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:29,130
Who initially thought these few things didn’t have enough meat?

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,330
I almost threw it away.

14
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:32,450
It's so bad that some people can't sleep tonight

15
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,830
I just want to see him unable to sleep with his concubine

16
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:36,470
Why did you agree so quickly this time?

17
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,190
Because at least he put it on the table

18
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,150
If it’s too low, you don’t have to sell it.

19
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:41,150
We won't wait for us to finish the work before making temporary changes.

20
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,850
Except trading the leg

21
00:00:43,290 --> 00:00:44,210
Who can help me with the pork?

22
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:48,090
In addition, according to the labor settlement, I like to listen to the work and say it first.

23
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:50,370
How can cutting meat and treating skin be considered another quarrel?

24
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,650
Both of them went to wash the internal organs

25
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,040
They've all gone to work, where are you?

26
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,640
How about doing the same thing as before with some extra revenge?

27
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:11,250
There are still things in the cave that need to be sorted out. I'll give you some salt. It's that kind of dirty work. I can't do it. Xu Yilu shouldn't do it. I shouldn't hit my dirty side. I took it myself. There's a black cloth inside. It's not intentional.
